      <activity id="61cd2122-a080-5e15-801a-cdebde253e97" activityNameId="8c8e9126-2da2-5c87-bd96-146e20e55cf8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rape seed conventional, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rape seed conventional, at farm
The inventory for the cultivation of rape in Germany is modelled with data from literature.;
UUID: ca85ca6f-6c30-37fe-b1e7-12a4430d6d5b
Cultivation of rape in Germany including use of diesel, machines, fertilizers, and pesticides.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Conventional production
Time period: Time of publications. Data for the fertilizers products and the transport distance to the farm are from 1996. Data for the pesticide use are from 2001. Data for the yield and lkand use are from 2006.
Production volume: Total production in Germany is around 416000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard distances. Emissions are calculated with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ca85ca6f-6c30-37fe-b1e7-12a4430d6d5b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
